WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:04.320
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not&nbsp;
Allowed To Do At The SCP Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:09.440
Dr. Bright is not allowed to declare&nbsp;
war on any country, thing, or person.

00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.480
Look, Jack, we know we told you that&nbsp;
you couldn’t take over the bodies of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:17.520
any monarchs or presidents, but you should know&nbsp;
that that also implicitly covered high-ranking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:22.560
generals and dictators of military juntas.
The Foundation doesn’t want you to declare&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:28.080
wars on ANYTHING - Even symbolic wars, like&nbsp;
that time you declared war on stress during&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.920
efforts to lower the collective&nbsp;
office blood pressure of Site-19.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.960
Let’s just try to avoid using such militarily&nbsp;
loaded language in the future, okay?

